{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37909","headline":"牛渚夜泊 · 崔涂","name":"牛渚夜泊","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"烟老石矶平，袁郎夜泛情。\n数吟人不遇，千古月空明。\n人事年年别，春潮日日生。\n无因逢谢尚，风物自凄清。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔涂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37909.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37909","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}